Founder decision D739: the one-sentence plan is right, but 1 run in 3 put a
sentence in front of it explaining the match („…შენი პირდაპირი კონტაქტია და
ნეტაიზე წევრია, და ის იცნობს …, ეს ზუსტად ემთხვევა შენს თხოვნას."). It must
go.

On a plan reply, a sentence (or paragraph) before the plan sentence that reads
as a match justification (two or more of: your contact / on Netai / knows /
matches, in ka, en, ru and es) is dropped. News ahead of the plan stays (the
tester's 1110), and a plan already in one sentence is untouched. Server-side
only; no prompt text changes.

DONE WHEN: 3 introduction plans in a row are only the one sentence and one
question.

